{"id":"f6b27f366a36","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/profile","lang":"en","title":"My Alumni profile","description":"Keep your profile updated and stay in contact with USI, your former classmates, and all of the USI Alumni community. Update \"My Alumni profile\" By keeping your personal and professional data up to date you will be able to: Subscribe and receive the Alumni newsletter Access the US","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Alumni","My Alumni"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/alumni-foto-4.jpg?itok=Smypo7kW","words":98,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/profilo","en":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/profile"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"My Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni"},{"label":"My Alumni profile","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/alumni-foto-4.jpg?itok=Smypo7kW","alt":"alumni-foto-4","caption":""}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Keep your profile updated and stay in contact with USI, your former classmates, and all of the USI Alumni community.</p> <p><strong>Update &quot;<a href=\"http://alumni.lu.usi.ch/loginscheda.aspx\">My Alumni profile</a></strong>&quot;<br> </p> <p>By keeping your personal and professional data up to date you will be able to:</p> <ul> <li>Subscribe and receive the <a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/106\">Alumni newsletter</a></li> <li>Access the <a href=\"https://alumni.lu.usi.ch/LoginAnnuario.aspx\">USI graduate yearbook</a></li> <li>Subscribe to the groups USI Alumni on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/groups/8250056/\">LinkedIn</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/?next=/usialumniservice/\">Instagram</a></li> <li>Subscribe and receive the <a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/104\">Career newsletter</a> (internships and job offers)</li> <li>Receive <a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/97\">USI Flash</a> (news from USI). To subscribe: <a href=\"mailto:flash@usi.ch\">flash@usi.ch</a></li> <li>Share your testimonials at USI (<a href=\"/en/originalnode/663\">USI Career Stories</a>, <a href=\"/en/originalnode/8977\">Visiting Alumni</a>, <a href=\"/en/universita/info/alumni/carriera/career-stories/info-day\">Master Info Day</a>)</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"My Alumni profile","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/profile"},{"label":"My career story","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story"},{"label":"Benefits","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefits"},{"label":"My Chapter","href":"/en/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Alumni calendar","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/alumni-calendar"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter Meetings","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Reunions","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Key figures","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-graduates"},{"label":"USI Career Stories","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories"},{"label":"USI Alumni Mentors","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-alumni-mentors"},{"label":"Placement survey","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/survey"},{"label":"Chapters","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/chapters"},{"label":"Executive Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/executive-alumni"},{"label":"Master groups","href":"/en/univ